expected_issues.description:
The environment variable lookup `System::getEnv('_APP_CONSOLE_DOMAIN', System::getEnv('_APP_DOMAIN', ''))` is called twice on consecutive lines (lines 46 and 47). This duplicates the logic and is inefficient. Consider storing the domain value in a variable first to avoid redundant calls and improve maintainability.

```suggestion
        $consoleDomain = System::getEnv('_APP_CONSOLE_DOMAIN', System::getEnv('_APP_DOMAIN', ''));
        $validator = new Domain($consoleDomain);
        $isDomainValid = !empty($consoleDomain) && $validator->isKnown() && !$validator->isTest();
```

